          "title": "Potential 1NF Violation (Multi-Valued Attribute) in \"products.tags\"",
          "category": "structure",
          "severity": "MEDIUM",
          "description": "The column \"tags\" in \"products\" suggests non-atomic multi-valued items stored in a single field (e.g. comma-separated lists).",
