          "title": "Table \"customers\" Lacks a Primary Key",
          "category": "structure",
          "severity": "CRITICAL",
          "description": "Table \"customers\" does not define any primary key constraint. Relational tables require unique record identification to maintain entity integrity.",
          "evidence": "Table primaryKey array is empty: []",
          "databaseObject": "customers",
          "table": "customers",
          "whyItMatters": "Without a primary key, tables cannot be reliably indexed or uniquely referenced by foreign keys. ORMs, replication engines, and data deduplication tools fail or produce unpredictable duplicates.",
