          "expectedImpact": "Guarantees entity uniqueness and allows foreign key reference integrity.",
          "suggestedFix": "ALTER TABLE \"customers\" ADD COLUMN id INTEGER;\nUPDATE \"customers\" SET id = rowid WHERE id IS NULL;\nCREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS \"idx_customers_id\" ON \"customers\" (id);",
