      "recommendation": "Evaluate whether this attribute is truly essential for all rows or should be extracted to a separate extension table.",
      "why": "Extremely sparse columns waste storage and can complicate queries requiring COALESCE or IS NOT NULL guards. Often indicates an optional feature that should be modeled in a separate table or attribute map.",
