      "findingId": "DES-NO-PK-activity_log",
      "title": "Table \"activity_log\" Lacks a Primary Key",
      "problem": "Table \"activity_log\" does not define any primary key constraint. Relational tables require unique record identification to maintain entity integrity.",
      "recommendation": "Add a surrogate primary key (e.g. \"id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT\" or UUID) to \"activity_log\".",
      "why": "Without a primary key, tables cannot be reliably indexed or uniquely referenced by foreign keys. ORMs, replication engines, and data deduplication tools fail or produce unpredictable duplicates.",
