      "id": "REC-DES-INFERRED-FK-activity_log-user_id",
      "projectId": "PRJ-1790270797566",
      "findingId": "DES-INFERRED-FK-activity_log-user_id",
      "title": "Inferred Relationship: \"activity_log.user_id\" → \"users\"",
      "problem": "Column \"user_id\" matches naming conventions for a reference to \"users\", but has NO formal FOREIGN KEY constraint enforced at the database level.",
      "recommendation": "Add a formal FOREIGN KEY constraint: \"activity_log.user_id\" REFERENCES \"users\"(\"id\").",
      "why": "Without an explicit FOREIGN KEY constraint, the database engine cannot prevent orphaned records if a parent row is deleted or modified. Referential integrity depends solely on application code correctness.",
      "expectedImpact": "Guarantees referential integrity and prevents orphaned child records.",
