      "problem": "Column \"national_id_number\" contains sensitive government identity records (SSN/National ID/Aadhaar). These identifiers must be protected with field-level encryption or pseudonymization.",
      "recommendation": "Encrypt this column at rest using envelope encryption (AES-256-GCM) or tokenization.",
